{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12308390","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12308390","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1230839001:1":{"text":"No, we just sailed near it, trying to catch some fish. Technically, we never reached the area where we could enter the fog...","source_cn":"没有，我们只是在迷雾附近航船，试图捕点鱼。按说还没到会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F4AB2787BF096D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230839002:1":{"text":"Even so, a thick mist caught us off guard and got us all turned around. ","source_cn":"但即使是这样，突然升起的浓雾让我们迷失了方向。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67B26242B8C3296A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230839003:1":{"text":"Then how did you make it back?","source_cn":"那你们是怎么平安回来的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE07C2321627BB1BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1230839004:1":{"text":"We abandoned ship and drifted for half a day before a small skiff picked us up!","source_cn":"我们跳了船，在海上漂流了大半天，才走运搭上一艘小型捕鱼船！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6565DADCF47FA73D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:水手伊桑":{"text":"Sailor Ethan","source":"水手伊桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:水手雅各布":{"text":"Sailor Jacob","source":"水手雅各布","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}